{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s0c993341219680fc","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-83dbce9a59821653c9f9","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s0c993341219680fc","text":"이 황금색 액체는 정말 달콤하네. 가서 더 많은 동료랑 나눠야겠어, 윙","speaker":"제단 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"제단 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3966149319221626857"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16992071898788197401"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-bd2a77021c57ea6cb495","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s0c993341219680fc","text":"황금 피를 훔치는 도둑이다!","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"제단 나비","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["12040688597328644008"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-619cd635053d7eaa3164","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s0c993341219680fc","text":"훔치다니? 이걸 어떻게 훔친다고 할 수 있어, 윙. 나도 황금색이니까——의기투합이라고 하는 게 맞지, 윙!","speaker":"제단 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"제단 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5467278239193110415"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16992071898788197401"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-e1f6655cb0a5aa45d8bd","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s0c993341219680fc","text":"어라, 왠지 좀 어지러운데. 설마 머리가 자라려는 건가, 윙?","speaker":"제단 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"제단 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["952546677048666148"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16992071898788197401"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-1affe8ebd2b22bc5ca7f","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s0c993341219680fc","text":"많이 마시면 안 좋아","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"제단 나비","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["9711622537349466695"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-20ee726de15d8374f8bf","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s0c993341219680fc","text":"안 좋다고? 이럴 수가… 약간 정신이 혼미한 것 같아, 윙","speaker":"제단 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"제단 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7435879726241185233"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16992071898788197401"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-9d88a4b7710cb4dd5c12","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s0c993341219680fc","text":"너도 마시고 싶어, 윙? 하지만 안 돼. 이 단지는 전부 내 거야…. 그런데 이상해. 머리가 갑자기 어지러워, 윙","speaker":"제단 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"제단 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3058208527234614047"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16992071898788197401"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p15862","title":"상호작용 기록","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-83dbce9a59821653c9f9","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-83dbce9a59821653c9f9","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"s0c993341219680fc","scene":"제단 나비","contextId":"wiki-context-67d4e3fcaafe59f2e57da5c9","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","revision":72039,"location":[1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-bd2a77021c57ea6cb495","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-bd2a77021c57ea6cb495","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"s0c993341219680fc","scene":"제단 나비","contextId":"wiki-context-67d4e3fcaafe59f2e57da5c9","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","revision":72039,"location":[1,1,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["680fa65e7c61-0"],"nextIds":["other-interaction-p15862-619cd635053d7eaa3164"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-619cd635053d7eaa3164","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-619cd635053d7eaa3164","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"s0c993341219680fc","scene":"제단 나비","contextId":"wiki-context-67d4e3fcaafe59f2e57da5c9","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","revision":72039,"location":[1,1,"reply",0,0],"co